	Gdn values of â1.8 M. The incubation times, neuropathological lesion
	profiles, and Gdn values indicate that MoSP1 prions differ from RML
	and many other prion strains derived from sheep with scrapie and
	cattle with bovine spongiform encephalopathy.},
